The claims directory is tracked even when it is empty.

Without this file git drops the directory as soon as the last claim is
released — which happened on 2026-09-11 00:45, when three lanes landed
in a row and the next agent found no `.work/active` at all. Nothing was
lost (a claim is a committed file, and the history shows each release),
but a missing claims directory reads like a broken protocol for exactly
as long as it takes to check, and checking is not free at 1am.
